# requests.http
# Testes da API com REST Client (VSCode)

### GET - Listar todas as questões
GET http://localhost:3000/api/questoes
Accept: application/json

###

### GET - Buscar por ID (existe)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/questoes/11154
Accept: application/json

###

### GET - Buscar por ID (não existe → 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/questoes/99999
Accept: application/json

###

### GET - ID inválido (→ 400)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/questoes/abc
Accept: application/json

###

### POST - Criar nova questão (→ 201)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/questoes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cod_disc": 82211,
  "enunciado": "Quanto é 9 × 9?",
  "alternativa_A": "81",
  "alternativa_B": "72",
  "alternativa_C": "63",
  "alternativa_D": "90",
  "alternativa_correta": "a",
  "dificuldade": "fácil"
}

###

### POST - Campos faltando (→ 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/questoes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enunciado": "Questão incompleta"
}

###

### POST - Letra inválida (→ 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/questoes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cod_disc": 82211,
  "enunciado": "Quanto é 4 + 4?",
  "alternativa_A": "6",
  "alternativa_B": "7",
  "alternativa_C": "8",
  "alternativa_D": "9",
  "alternativa_correta": "e",
  "dificuldade": "fácil"
}

###

### PUT - Atualizar enunciado (→ 200)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/questoes/11154
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enunciado": "Quanto é 8 + 7? (revisado)"
}

###

### PUT - Atualizar alternativa correta e dificuldade (→ 200)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/questoes/22468
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "alternativa_correta": "b",
  "dificuldade": "médio"
}

###

### PUT - Questão inexistente (→ 404)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/questoes/99999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enunciado": "Isso não existe"
}

###

### PUT - Nenhum campo enviado (→ 400)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/questoes/11154
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### DELETE - Deletar questão (→ 200)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/questoes/90003
Accept: application/json

###

### DELETE - Questão inexistente (→ 404)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/questoes/99999
Accept: application/json

###

### DELETE - ID inválido (→ 400)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/questoes/xyz
Accept: application/json